FOLLOWUPS.md
PROOF.md
scripts/kilo-benchmarks/cache/update.log*

# Per-deploy state file persistence (T2-01 G-F3). Each fabrik apply writes
# .fabrik/state/<id>.json; destroys move them to _destroyed/. Local audit
# trail only — never committed.
/.fabrik/state/

# Review bundles (T3-03 G-D3). `fabrik review` writes diff + spec + preplan +
# resolved registrars into .fabrik/review/<ts>.md. Local artefact; PR diff
# already captures the change set — never committed.
/.fabrik/review/

# Local artifacts (originally appended by a `fabrik scaffold update` run in the hub)
#
# IMPORTANT — this is /opt/fabrik, the HUB. Fabrik-synced SOURCE files are
# CANONICAL here and MUST stay tracked: .windsurf/, .windsurfrules, CLAUDE.md,
# AGENTS.md, AGENTS-compact.md, opencode.json, scripts/run*, and
# docs/reference/long-command-monitoring.md. They are ignored only in downstream
# *projects* (via the synced block generated by fabrik_synced_manifest.py).
# Do NOT re-add those source files here — only genuine local artifacts belong below.
*.code-workspace
*.db
*.log
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.tmp
*.token
.droid/.kilo_cache_last_refresh
.droid/docs_log/
.droid/docs_queue/
.droid/kilo_models_cache.json
.droid/kilo_usage.jsonl
.droid/reviews/
.droid/traycer-reports/*.md
.env.backup
.env.sysadmin
.modal.toml
.factory/consultations/
/tmp/
Audio_downloads/
Logs/
YT_audio_text/
backups/
cookies*.txt
db/migrations/*.sql
docs/reference/*Search*.md
exports/
pipeline_output/
retry_queue.json
state.json

# Sessional safety backups — files created before destructive edits
# (e.g. `cp AGENTS.md AGENTS.md.backup.YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS`). Kept on disk for
# the duration of the session, never committed to remote history.
*.backup.*
*.bak.*

# Derived kilo pipeline cache — regenerated every run, never source
scripts/kilo-benchmarks/cache/
# Persistent microbench_coding run cache — completions samples survive process
# exit so downstream sanitize/eval failures are $0-recoverable
scripts/kilo-benchmarks/.microbench_cache/
